wiki/Layer_Reinforcement\" title=\"Layer Reinforcement\">Layer Reinforcement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Manifested_Defense\" title=\"Manifested Defense\">Manifested Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Multilayered_Defense\" title=\"Multilayered Defense\">Multilayered Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerating_Defense\" title=\"Regenerating Defense\">Regenerating Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Construction\" title=\"Shield Construction\">Shield Construction</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inducement\" title=\"Inducement\">Inducement</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Action_Inducement\" title=\"Action Inducement\">Action Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assistance_Inducement\" title=\"Assistance Inducement\">Assistance Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Augmentation\" title=\"Augmentation\">Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Binding\" title=\"Binding\">Binding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Change_Inducement\" title=\"Change Inducement\">Change Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Control_Inducement\" title=\"Control Inducement\">Control Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Inducement\" title=\"Damage Inducement\">Damage Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Freedom_Inducement\" title=\"Freedom Inducement\">Freedom Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Freeing\" title=\"Freeing\">Freeing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">Healing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitation_Inducement\" title=\"Incapacitation Inducement\">Incapacitation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Limitation_Inducement\" title=\"Limitation Inducement\">Limitation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Negation\" title=\"Negation\">Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_Inducement\" title=\"Protection Inducement\">Protection Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reduction\" title=\"Reduction\">Reduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transmutation\" title=\"Transmutation\">Transmutation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerability_Inducement\" title=\"Vulnerability Inducement\">Vulnerability Inducement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interaction\" title=\"Interaction\">Interaction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Access_%26_Occlusion\" title=\"Access &amp; Occlusion\">Access &amp; Occlusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Activation_%26_Deactivation\" title=\"Activation &amp; Deactivation\">Activation &amp; Deactivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Attraction_%26_Repulsion\" title=\"Attraction &amp; Repulsion\">Attraction &amp; Repulsion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Banishment\" title=\"Banishment\">Banishment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">Channeling</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Compression\" title=\"Compression\">Compression</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Customization\" title=\"Customization\">Customization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Detection\" title=\"Detection\">Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Expansion\" title=\"Expansion\">Expansion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Expulsion\" title=\"Expulsion\">Expulsion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Imperceptibility\" title=\"Imperceptibility\">Imperceptibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Insertion_%26_Removal\" title=\"Insertion &amp; Removal\">Insertion &amp; Removal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Psionics\" title=\"Psionics\">Psionics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sealing\" title=\"Sealing\">Sealing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Summoning\" title=\"Summoning\">Summoning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unsealing\" title=\"Unsealing\">Unsealing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Warping\" title=\"Warping\">Warping</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_Manipulation\" title=\"Status Manipulation\">Status Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Action_Manipulation\" title=\"Action Manipulation\">Action Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aspect_Manipulation\" title=\"Aspect Manipulation\">Aspect Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Control_Manipulation\" title=\"Control Manipulation\">Control Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_Manipulation\" title=\"Essence Manipulation\">Essence Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Form_Manipulation\" title=\"Form Manipulation\">Form Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interaction_Manipulation\" title=\"Interaction Manipulation\">Interaction Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mode_Switching\" title=\"Mode Switching\">Mode Switching</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Manipulation\" title=\"Property Manipulation\">Property Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quality_Manipulation\" title=\"Quality Manipulation\">Quality Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_Effect_Inducement\" title=\"Status Effect Inducement\">Status Effect Inducement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Support_Manipulation\" title=\"Support Manipulation\">Support Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Charging\" title=\"Charging\">Charging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Coating\" title=\"Coating\">Coating</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Manifested_Support\" title=\"Manifested Support\">Manifested Support</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Object_Refinement\" title=\"Object Refinement\">Object Refinement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Penetration_%26_Protection\" title=\"Penetration &amp; Protection\">Penetration &amp; Protection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quality_Enhancement\" title=\"Quality Enhancement\">Quality Enhancement</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Attacks\" title=\"Absorption Attacks\">Absorption Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Constructs\" title=\"Absorption Constructs\">Absorption Constructs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Defense\" title=\"Absorption Defense\">Absorption Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Generation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Generation\">Absorption Energy Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Mode\" title=\"Absorption Mode\">Absorption Mode</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Slash\" title=\"Absorption Slash\">Absorption Slash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorptive_Merging\" title=\"Absorptive Merging\">Absorptive Merging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Immunity\" title=\"Assimilation Immunity\">Assimilation Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Charged_Attacks\" title=\"Trait:Charged Attacks\">Charged Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Wave_Emission\" title=\"Elemental Wave Emission\">Elemental Wave Emission</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Attacks\" title=\"Absorption Attacks\">Absorption Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Merging\" title=\"Combat Merging\">Combat Merging</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Combat\" title=\"Elemental Combat\">Elemental Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Combat\" title=\"Entity Combat\">Entity Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Esoteric_Combat\" title=\"Esoteric Combat\">Esoteric Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Combat\" title=\"Property Combat\">Property Combat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Combat\" title=\"Reality Combat\">Reality Combat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infusion\" title=\"Infusion\">Infusion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Elemental Infusion\">Elemental Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Infusion\" title=\"Entity Infusion\">Entity Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Esoteric_Infusion\" title=\"Esoteric Infusion\">Esoteric Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Infusion\" title=\"Property Infusion\">Property Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Infusion\" title=\"Reality Infusion\">Reality Infusion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May need physical contact with the subject to either activate or maintain the effect.</li>\n<li>May only be able to use it on specific types of subjects, usually either oneself, others or objects such as tools or weapons.</li>\n<li>May be limited on how much control the user has over their subjects and what they infuse them with.</li>\n<li>May be tied to the user's physical and/or mental condition.</li>\n<li>May be a limit to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Various <a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Chakra_Absorption_Techniques\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Chakra Absorption Techniques\">Chakra Absorption Techniques</a> Users (<i>Naruto/Boruto: Naruto Next Generations</i>)</li>\n<li>Pokémon who can use <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Drain_Punch_(move)\">Drain Punch</a> (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Infusion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focu